				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Then I'd rake in the cash!:If only Gensokyo had a sea...:There's not much to extract salt from besides bodies, though... and that's pretty much the same thing as taking shirikodama, huh?")%」
			CASE 5
				PRINTFORML 「My multitools never have enough tools, so I'm upgrading my multi-multitool with more multitools!」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I need more tools to upgrade it, though...:After that, I'll use my multi-multitool to build a multi-multi-multitool!:It's getting so heavy, I need to make it lighter so I can fit in more multitools!")%」
			CASE 6
				PRINTFORML 「Nobody has time for cooking, so I'm trying to perfect my instant cucumber fryer!」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I'll make sure it doesn't burn them black, so help me!:Though personally, I like them raw...:By the way, with just a small modification, it can become a flamethrower, too!")%」
			CASE 7
