				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Once I finish tweaking my drill, we'll have just what we need to extract it!:That's what my drill project is for!:I'm tweaking the drill machine ahead of time in preparation.")%」
			CASE 17
				PRINTFORML 「Our brain wave monitoring system needs an upgrade, big time.」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I got possessed and knocked out once and it didn't help at all.:Medical science isn't exactly my forté, but...:If I develop it enough, maybe I can make it read minds...")%」
