				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"What if you get attacked while you're making breakfast?:You can eat the Danmaku afterwards, just like my cucumber and shirikodama Spell Cards!:I want to say that I've won a Spell Card duel using toast!")%」
			CASE 19
