				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I've gotta keep my underwater pizza maker technology at the bleeding edge!:Why eat pizza underwater? Heh. Once you've tried it, you'll understand.:I'm not lying, really!")%」
			CASE 20
				PRINTFORML 「My universal kappakopter attachment can make anything fly in place.」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"At least, that's the idea... I need to iron out the bugs.:It's kinda dangerous, though...:You can use it as a Danmaku slave, too.")%」
			CASE 21
				PRINTFORML 「I don't want to get up and feed myself in the morning. That's why we have machines!」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"My automatic feeder keeps poking me in the eyes, though. Needs more testing...:My breakfast maker can only make cucumber dishes, but that's fine, right?:Problem is, if the maker-slash-feeder becomes popular, none of the kappa will ever get out of bed...")%」
			CASE 22
				PRINTFORML 「Someone told me that music is more artistic than engineering. I'm going to prove her wrong!」
				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"With the power of water, even a machine can be a whole orchestra!:The flow of the river will compose unique music every time with my machine! I just need to figure out how to make it sound good...:Machines can do anything! They're the best!")%」
			CASE 23
