				PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I'm thinking we should capture them, tag them, and release them again.:There's a risk of poachers, so we need a better system for human conservation.:As friends of the humans, we can't let them walk into danger! They need to be tagged and tracked!")%」
