					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(0,@"「Add %SPLIT_G(@"a proximity sensor:a manual override:a self-destruct system:a bomb to it:some security features:a diagnostic monitor:a locking system:more redundancy:some more gears and wires to it:a radio")%.」","l")
					PRINTFORMDL A kappa wandering by gives her opinion. More and more begin to gather, making suggestions.
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(2,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Make it smaller:Make it shoot bullets:Make it exteeeend:Add gold plating:Fuse it with your %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME(1)%!:Give it a face:Make it tell the time:Increase the output")%!」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(0,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Put a calculator in it:Give it more speed settings:Make it go really, really fast:Make it modular:Make it shoot lasers:Make it bigger")%!」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(1,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Pretend I made it:Put a secret microphone in it:Make it shoot lightning:Make it dispense cucumbers:Make it cry if you damage it:Make it read books:Give it a cuter name")%!」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(3,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Make it transform:Make it bright %SPLIT_G(@"red:blue:green:yellow:white:purple:pink")%:Give it a theme song:Make it sing:Make it shoot fire:Make it explode")%!」","l")
					PRINTFORMDL No progress gets made...
				CASE 2
						;A sudden argument you're not involved in.
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(0,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Why would you put in a part like that?!:What's wrong with you?! I told you to %SPLIT_G(@"put on the clamp:install the safety:test it")% first!:Why do you keep adding superfluous parts?!:Stop it! You're going to damage the %SPLIT_G(@"drivetrain:internals:wiring:lens:motor:engine:casing")%!:That's not in the design! We're running out of materials!")%」 ")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(2,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"I don't care, I've wanted to add this from the beginning!:Don't try to stomp on my creative spirit!:So what?! Engineering isn't a science!:Why do you always have to have your way?!:Don't try to stop me, I'm on a roll!:You doubt me now, but you'll be singing my praises when this works!:Geez, let me live a little!")%」","l")
					PRINTFORMDL Nearby in the hideout, a pair of kappa are arguing about a machine they're working on.
					PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Uwaah, this always happens...:Wonder what it's about this time...:Those two never stop...:Those two again... Well, they're pretty close.:Wow, they're taking it pretty seriously.:Looks like they're getting passionate about that project.:I wonder if they'll compromise this time.:What's their problem now?")%」
					PRINTFORMDL It's drawing a bit of a crowd...
				CASE 3
						;The other kappa look up to Nitori, who doesn't know how to handle their praise, but craves it anyway.
					PRINTFORMDL The subject turns to Nitori's %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME()% project and she shows you her progress.
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(2,@"","l")
					PRINTFORMDL 「%SPLIT_G(@"Hey, Nitori! Whatcha workin' on?:Nitoriii! Is that a new project?:Hey, Nitori, what's up?:Is that your project, Nitori?:Hey, let me see!:What's that?:Hey, Nitori's showing her project!:Is that a Nitori project I see?:Look, it's Nitori's project!")%」
					PRINTFORMDL A kappa wanders by to take a look, followed by another... and then another...
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(0,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Wow, what is it?:Looks cool!:Nitori's making this?:Let me see!:Nitori, you've done it again!:Wow, neat!:Nice!")%」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(1,@"「%SPLIT_G(@":Awesome!:How do you get so many ideas?:I want one!:When's it gonna be done?:Hey, I can't see it!:What's this supposed to be?:What does it do?:Looks amazing!:Nice design!")%」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(2,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"Sweet!:I wish I could build like you...:Is this your own idea?:Makes me jealous...:Does it have any secret features?:I love it!:You're so cool, Nitori...:Look at how well designed it is...")%」")
					CALL K51_EGG_KAPPA_TEXT(3,@"「%SPLIT_G(@"What does that part do?:Give me one for free!:Let me help you!:Teach me, Nitori!:Woah!:It looks even better than the %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME(1)%!")%」","l")
					PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"H-Hey, one at a time...:Aw, you guys...:I-It's not that great...:Uh, heh heh... Well, y'know...")%」
					PRINTFORMDL Nitori %SPLIT_G(@"laughs:blushes:fidgets her legs")%, enjoying the attention.
			ENDSELECT
		ELSE
				;If you're not in the hideout, Nitori will just hint at it instead.
			PRINTFORML 「I'd like to ask the other kappa for %SPLIT_G(@"help:their opinion")% on my project, but it's too dangerous.」
			PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Get any of them involved in your project and they'll all start arguing about how to do it right:Scope creep is a positive for them:They'll jump on board for a while, then get tired of it:They'd turn it into something completely different:They'd waste the whole day talking about it:They've got, you know, creative differences")%...」
			SIF !RAND:12
				PRINTFORML 「Not that I'm much better.」
		ENDIF
	CASE 8
			;A sudden idea.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Hmm:Uhh:Wait:......:%SPLIT_G(@"Hang:Hold")% on")%...」
		PRINTFORMDL Nitori spaces out in the middle of the conversation.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Now that you mention it:Come to think of it:Since you've said that:Speaking of which")%, %SPLIT_G(@"maybe I could get more power if I:it might be more efficient if I:it'd be cheaper to:it'd save a lot of hassle if I changed the:it'd use less energy if:I could cut the cost by:the %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME()% might turn out better if I")%...」
		PRINTFORMDL She starts %SPLIT_G(@"mumbling:making plans:rethinking her project")%...
	CASE 9
			;Bonding over machines.
		IF TALENT:51:恋人 || TALENT:51:恋慕
			PRINTFORML 「Hey, %SPLIT_G(@"tell me what you think about:give me your take on:take a look at:look over")% these!」
