			PRINTFORMDL Nitori watches you closely while you talk.
		ELSEIF ABL:51:親密 < 3
			IF !RAND:2
				PRINTFORML 「You'd better not underestimate machines. %SPLIT_G(@"They'll remember it:They won't underestimate you:They can do anything you can dream of:They can even make strong Spell Cards:Technology is power! That's why the kappa are strong")%!」
				PRINTFORMDL Nitori blusters and shows off her knowledge.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「I'm not boring you, am I? ...Just making sure!」
				PRINTFORMDL Nitori blushes as she notices she's rambling.
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			IF IS_NONHUMAN(MASTER)
				PRINTFORML 「It's great that I can talk to you about this. Most youkai think "drive train" is an incantation...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「It's great that I can talk to you about this. Most humans think "drive train" is an incantation...」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORML 「Speaking of drive trains, %SPLIT_G(@"I found some good ones:I found a neat way to repair them:you can clean them like this:I came up with a new design")%...」
			PRINTFORMDL Nitori rambles on with a big smile.
		ENDIF
	CASE 10
			;Opining.
		PRINTFORML 「Every new invention needs %SPLIT_G(@"to be waterproof, especially if it uses high voltage electricity:some character. It's no fun otherwise:some redundancy, especially on the waterproofing")%!」
		PRINTFORMDL Nitori shares some engineering opinions.
	CASE 11
			;What to do with an invention after it's finished.
		PRINTFORML 「It's not over when it's built. %SPLIT_G(@"You'll be customizing it forever!:There are always issues and maintenance...:That's when you iterate and make new variants. And marketing, too...:You've gotta sell it, or what's the point? ...Besides fun, I guess.")%」
ENDSELECT

@K51_EGG_CONVERSATION_COLLABORATION(Counter)
#DIM DYNAMIC Counter
#DIM DYNAMIC TopicModifier
