	CASE 2
			;Advertising the bazaar.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Remember to:Don't forget to:Make sure you")% %SPLIT_G(@"stop by:come to:visit")% the next kappa bazaar! %SPLIT_G(@"We've got lots of cool stuff for sale!:You won't believe what you'll see!:Everything you can dream of, at affordable prices!:We've got lots of brand new products and attractions!")%」
	CASE 3
			;Coupons.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Ever seen the Manzairaku? I could give you a discount ticket...:Want a gift voucher for a kappa product or service? Give them to your friends and family!")%」
		PRINTFORMDL Nitori waves a handful of tickets in your face.
	CASE 4
			;Shilling the thermal jar if you don't own it.
		IF ITEM:保温ジャー
			GOTO TOP
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"You like exploring, right? Want a thermal jar for long trips?:Want one of my thermal jars? I just so happen to have an extra in my backpack.:Need something to keep your food hot? I've got a thermal jar for you!")%」
			PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"It keeps hot stuff hot and cold stuff cold all day long!:You won't regret it when you're out exploring!:It's really cheap for the value!")%」
		ENDIF
	CASE 5
			;Reminding you to buy stuff from her.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"If you need anything:By the way:Just so you know:In case you're wondering:If there's anything you want")%, %SPLIT_G(@"I've got my pack full of goodies for sale.:I brought all my merchandise with me.:I've still got some merchandise in my backpack.")%」
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"I'll give you a good deal if you buy now...:Wanna buy something?:You'll get it cheaper and higher quality with me than anywhere else, promise!:I can unload it if you want a look...")%」
	CASE 6
