	CASE 9
			;Youkai Mountain residents.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Having a harvest god nearby is pretty handy, I guess. We get her blessing for our cucumber growing facilities.:The amanojaku came by, saying we should be fighting the %SPLIT_G(@"yamawaro:tengu")%... I can't say I wasn't tempted.:It's tough to find a market for machines or labor on the mountain, but sometimes there are gods who'll buy from us.:Be careful exploring around the mountain. The yamawaro like to hunt and play war games in the forests.")%」
